  "local_policies": [
    "Halveria uses the existing completed declared original Rush minion attack keyword query, including its exact natural-death facts, and ordinary captured friendly board+1 Attack group. Source must still be living; all current active friendly board minions including source match, hand/deck excluded.",
    "Scabbs original Combo installs one ordinary player CostSpec delta-2 with two uses and expiry at current global turn. All playable card kinds qualify, zero floor and zero-cost plays use the existing consumption contract; hero power/automatic cast do not consume it. Budget survives later source departure and has no new program/profile.",
    "Xyrella reads actual Health restored by captured own sources this turn to any character, not nominal healing or only own targets. Freeze this amount once at actual Battlecry execution and use ordinary MINION_ABILITY DamageBatch over current enemy minions; not hero/dormant and no native Spell Damage opt-in.",
    "Nozdormu sets each player permanent maximum to10 with empty added crystals, preserving ordinary current spent/available, temporary/overload and cap rules. Ordinary ChangeManaCrystals receives the fresh delta via native actor-first per-recipient callbacks; above10 reduces to10 without rewriting mana_cap. Configured cap below10 remains the existing engine limit.",
    "Nozdormu empty-crystal note is from the indexed community wiki, which cites Celestalon2019-11-02; exact original tweet was not retrieved. Complete official faces prove printed text, not this current CN edge interpretation. No claim of live CN calibration.",
    "Altruis reads each completed own physical PlayRecord original hand_index/hand_size, with one-card hand one trigger. Original left/right membership is not recomputed after payment, draws or reactive hand changes. Enemy/automatic CAST and summons do not fabricate own physical hand plays. Current enemy hero plus all active minions receive ordinary simultaneous ability damage. Native body explicitly excludes its own original hand-play root, following the already-on-board listener contract. No public trigger engine change."
  ],
